      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T17:38:00+08:00",
      "reason": "The approved verification invokes root contract tasks and fixed official generators, but T-02 originally made Taskfile.yml and dependency lock manifests read-only",
      "resolution": "Serialize the minimal root task registrations and exact task-set assertion, exact Go/pnpm dependencies, and the exact @redocly/cli@2.48.0 release-age allowlist under T-02 without weakening policy or changing the Spec/ADR"
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-D02",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-02",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T18:28:00+08:00",
      "reason": "The first review proved that the fragment template targets the pre-reconstruction UI directory and cannot represent multiple fragments owned by one target module",
      "resolution": "Keep T-02 writes inside its existing template and tooling paths, but make generated module metadata declare an explicit owner and the Spec-authoritative go-admin-plus-ui/packages/domains target; no future module source is written by T-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-D03",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-02",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T18:28:00+08:00",
      "reason": "The existing public generate task invokes superseded generators, including an unmanaged swag executable that fails from a provisioned repository, and would otherwise split the public generation contract",
      "resolution": "Replace the public generate delegation with the canonical OpenAPI generator; legacy scripts remain read-only expand-phase inventory until their T-21 contraction owner removes them, but are no longer part of the public command plane"
    },
    {
      "id": "T05-D01",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-05",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T19:31:00+08:00",
      "reason": "T-05 requires app-shell to be a real workspace package with public exports, but its writable path list omitted the package manifest while allowing only src/core",
      "resolution": "Authorize only go-admin-plus-ui/packages/app-shell/package.json as a T-05 shared path; keep all other app-shell files outside src/core read-only"
    },
    {
      "id": "T05-D02",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-05",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T20:09:00+08:00",
      "reason": "ADR-011 requires runtime adapters under packages/adapters/{browser,desktop} and Apps to select rather than own adapters, but T-05 omitted adapter package paths",
      "resolution": "Authorize go-admin-plus-ui/packages/adapters/browser/** and only the desktop adapter package manifest; move the browser runtime implementation out of admin-web while reserving desktop adapter source for T-16"
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-D04",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-02",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T22:26:11+08:00",
      "reason": "T-06 clean preflight proved the canonical TypeScript client and contract tool root still target the legacy go-admin-ui-plus workspace and each module fragment would rewrite the T-02 shared generated manifest",
      "resolution": "Reopen T-02, migrate the canonical API client/tool root to go-admin-plus-ui, and keep the shared manifest canonical-only while module outputs remain deterministically generated and checked from their fragments"
    },
    {
      "id": "T06-D01",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-06",
      "owner": "codex-root",
      "approved_at": "2026-08-26T22:26:11+08:00",
      "reason": "The precreated IAM workspace package manifests cannot expose or compile the Session slice without declaring public exports and direct API client, domain, and Vue dependencies",
      "resolution": "Authorize only the two IAM package manifests and the new workspace lockfile for exact Session exports and direct dependencies after T02-D04 is integrated"
    },
    {
      "id": "T05-D03",
      "level": "ticket",
      "status": "approved",
      "ticket_id": "T-05",
